OL,3,GNEWSAWeather fan's guide to best days
OL,4,Ato peg washing out
OL,5,
OL,6,FA weather enthusiast has created a
OL,7,Fwebsite to answer a question many
OL,8,Fpeople ask before stepping into the
OL,9,Fgarden: is it a good day to put the
OL,10,Fwashing out?
OL,12,FThe Washing Line Index was built by
OL,13,Famateur weather watcher Stephen
OL,14,FVincent, from Sheffield, and uses live
OL,15,Fforecast data to assess drying
OL,16,Fconditions for locations across the UK.
OL,18,FIt gives a "shirt rating" and drying
OL,19,Fscore out of 100, with separate morning
OL,20,Fand afternoon forecasts based on
OL,21,Ffactors including sunshine, rain,
OL,22,Fhumidity and wind.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
