OL,3,GNEWSAWeather fan's guide to best days
OL,4,Ato peg washing out
OL,5,
OL,6,FVincent said: "It's all working in the
OL,7,Fbackground from live weather data, then
OL,8,Fdisplaying what we'd like to know and
OL,9,Fcomputing it into a score."
